# Supabase cloud-save configuration (OPTIONAL).
# The game runs fully offline / anonymously with local saves when these are unset —
# cloud sync simply stays disabled. Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the
# values from your Supabase project (Dashboard → Project Settings → API).
#
# IMPORTANT: only the PUBLIC anon key belongs in the frontend. NEVER put the
# service_role key here — it would be shipped to every browser. Row Level Security
# (see supabase-notes.md) is what keeps each user's save private.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-public-anon-key
